      "interactiveButtonsHeader": {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "",
        "media": null
      },
      "interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>Here is how it works:<br>\n<br>\n1️⃣ You pay a flat fee and enter your case details online: the amount, the key dates and who owes you. No document uploads.<br>\n2️⃣ Our team verifies the facts you submitted.<br>\n3️⃣ A fact-verified legal notice is sent to the other party by Email and WhatsApp, and by Speed Post if you choose it. Most notices go out within 24 hours.<br>\n4️⃣ If they do not respond, up to 2 more escalating notices follow in Week 2 and Week 3.<br>\n5️⃣ You track delivery and replies from your dashboard.</p>",
      "interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
      "interactiveButtonsItems": [
        {
          "id": "WVvTtsN",
          "buttonText": "Get started",
          "nodeResultId": "main_question-SZLuy"
        },
        {
          "id": "pbKhIFL",
          "buttonText": "More questions",
          "nodeResultId": "main_list-jbTLy"
        }
      ],
      "interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
      "interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "",
      "id": "main_buttons-llLpq",
      "flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
      "flowNodePosition": {
        "posX": "1000",
        "posY": "0"
      },
      "isStartNode": false
    },
    {
      "interactiveButtonsHeader": {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "",
        "media": null
      },
      "interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>Our fee is a flat ₹999 per opposite party.<br>\n<br>\n✅ Up to 3 fact-verified legal notices by Email and WhatsApp<br>\n✅ Delivery tracking<br>\n✅ Multi-stage escalation<br>\n<br>\nOptional: Speed Post for all 3 notices at ₹450 per party, charged at cost.<br>\n<br>\nNo retainer, no hourly billing and no commission on the money you recover.</p>",
      "interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
      "interactiveButtonsItems": [
        {
          "id": "LmidXxf",
          "buttonText": "Get started",
          "nodeResultId": "main_question-SZLuy"
        },
        {
          "id": "AAwbjrF",
          "buttonText": "More questions",
          "nodeResultId": "main_list-jbTLy"
        }
      ],
      "interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
      "interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "",
      "id": "main_buttons-soEki",
      "flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
      "flowNodePosition": {
        "posX": "1000",
        "posY": "520"
      },
      "isStartNode": false
    },
    {
      "interactiveButtonsHeader": {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "",
        "media": null
      },
      "interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>We handle straightforward money disputes for individuals and businesses, anywhere in India:<br>\n<br>\n• Unpaid salary and employment dues<br>\n• Business dues and unpaid invoices<br>\n• Freelancer and client payments<br>\n• Money lent to a friend or relative<br>\n• Cheque bounce (Section 138)<br>\n• Security deposit and rent<br>\n• Property and builder refunds<br>\n• Consumer refunds for a product or service<br>\n• School, college and coaching fee refunds<br>\n• Flight, travel and hotel refunds<br>\n• Insurance claims<br>\n• Cyber fraud and bank disputes</p>",
      "interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
      "interactiveButtonsItems": [
        {
          "id": "pfKXIsa",
          "buttonText": "Get started",
          "nodeResultId": "main_question-SZLuy"
        },
        {
          "id": "CfUYsEp",
          "buttonText": "More questions",
          "nodeResultId": "main_list-jbTLy"
        }
      ],
      "interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
      "interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "",
      "id": "main_buttons-OLQCu",
      "flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
      "flowNodePosition": {
        "posX": "1000",
        "posY": "1040"
      },
      "isStartNode": false
    },
    {
      "interactiveButtonsHeader": {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "",
        "media": null
      },
      "interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>The first notice usually goes out within 24 hours of you submitting your case. Follow-up notices go out in Week 2 and Week 3 if there is no response.<br>\n<br>\nHow quickly the matter resolves depends on how the other party responds.</p>",
      "interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
      "interactiveButtonsItems": [
        {
          "id": "fTAwUKD",
          "buttonText": "Get started",
          "nodeResultId": "main_question-SZLuy"
        },
        {
          "id": "ZdKMaCY",
          "buttonText": "More questions",
          "nodeResultId": "main_list-jbTLy"
        }
      ],
      "interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
      "interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "",
      "id": "main_buttons-lkwIC",
      "flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
      "flowNodePosition": {
        "posX": "1000",
        "posY": "1560"
      },
      "isStartNode": false
    },
    {
      "interactiveButtonsHeader": {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "",
        "media": null
      },
      "interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>You do not need to upload any documents.<br>\n<br>\nYou simply type in the key facts: the amount owed, the important dates, what was agreed and the other party's contact details. Our team verifies these facts before the notice is sent.<br>\n<br>\nKeep your agreements, invoices, payment receipts and chats safe with you, as you may need them later.</p>",
      "interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
      "interactiveButtonsItems": [
        {
          "id": "tsjxvsT",
          "buttonText": "Get started",
          "nodeResultId": "main_question-SZLuy"
        },
        {
          "id": "EReqQhg",
          "buttonText": "More questions",
          "nodeResultId": "main_list-jbTLy"
        }
      ],
      "interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
      "interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "",
      "id": "main_buttons-urlpM",
      "flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
      "flowNodePosition": {
        "posX": "1000",
        "posY": "2080"
      },
      "isStartNode": false
    },
    {
      "interactiveButtonsHeader": {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "",
        "media": null
      },
      "interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>If the other party does not respond to the first notice, we send follow-up notices in Week 2 and Week 3, each more urgent than the last.<br>\n<br>\nIf all notices are ignored, we guide you on the next step. Depending on the dispute, that may be a consumer complaint, the labour commissioner, a civil suit or a cheque bounce case under Section 138.</p>",
      "interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
      "interactiveButtonsItems": [
        {
          "id": "MfqtPqI",
          "buttonText": "Get started",
          "nodeResultId": "main_question-SZLuy"
        },
        {
          "id": "dJHVRrZ",
          "buttonText": "More questions",
          "nodeResultId": "main_list-jbTLy"
        }
      ],
      "interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
      "interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "",
      "id": "main_buttons-kWRES",
      "flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
      "flowNodePosition": {
        "posX": "1000",
        "posY": "2600"
      },
      "isStartNode": false
    },
    {
      "interactiveButtonsHeader": {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "",
        "media": null
      },
      "interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>Yes. Our legal notice formats have been prepared by a lawyer.<br>\n<br>\nYour notice is built on those formats using the facts you submit, which our team verifies before sending. It is not individually customised by a lawyer for your specific situation.<br>\n<br>\nFor personal legal advice or court representation, you would need to hire an advocate separately.</p>",
      "interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
      "interactiveButtonsItems": [
        {
          "id": "NupOjej",
          "buttonText": "Get started",
          "nodeResultId": "main_question-SZLuy"
        },
        {
          "id": "FpMiPSP",
          "buttonText": "More questions",
          "nodeResultId": "main_list-jbTLy"
        }
      ],
      "interactiveButtonsUserInputVariable": "",
      "interactiveButtonsDefaultNodeResultId": "",
      "id": "main_buttons-CeMGb",
      "flowNodeType": "InteractiveButtons",
      "flowNodePosition": {
        "posX": "1000",
        "posY": "3120"
      },
      "isStartNode": false
    },
    {
      "interactiveButtonsHeader": {
        "type": "Text",
        "text": "",
        "media": null
      },
      "interactiveButtonsBody": "<p>We cannot guarantee that the money will be recovered. A legal notice is a formal demand, and the outcome depends on the other party.<br>\n<br>\nRefunds are not available once fact verification begins, for incorrect recipient details, or after a notice has been issued.</p>",
      "interactiveButtonsFooter": "",
      "interactiveButtonsItems": [
        {
          "id": "NOqYJDn",
          "buttonText": "Get started",
          "nodeResultId": "main_question-SZLuy"
        },
        {
          "id": "jQHWpRh",
          "buttonText": "More questions",
          "nodeResultId": "main_list-jbTLy"
        }
      ],
